{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00365","headline":"游丈人观谒先帝御容 · 蜀太妃徐氏","name":"游丈人观谒先帝御容","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共谒御容仪，还同在禁闱。\n笙歌喧宝殿，彩仗耀金徽。\n清泪沾罗袂，红霞拂绣衣。\n九疑山水远，无路继湘妃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蜀太妃徐氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}